I’m thinking about creating concise configuration overrides for the current repo and some important ones. It might feature the top few repos instead of all. I could provide a manual summary for an overview of the repo, maybe including specific ones like github-minimum-intelligence and japer-technology.github.io, while others can use default GitHub descriptions. I need to create a snapshot file with JSON data and ensure the app sorts by updated_at in descending order."},{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Addressing site configuration issues**

I'm recognizing some potential issues. First, fetching the GitHub API should be fine since CORS is supported. However, if the rate limit is exceeded, I’ll need a fallback to the snapshot. I might also consider including a `<meta name="viewport">` tag but I'm unsure about theme toggles. It would be valuable to mention the last live refresh on the page, and I think showing "Source: live GitHub API" or "snapshot" could be helpful. I'll start writing the necessary files carefully, including index, styles, app, data files, README, and .nojekyll."}]}

arguments.content:
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #08111f;
  --panel: rgba(12, 24, 43, 0.9);
  --panel-strong: #10233f;
  --panel-soft: rgba(16, 35, 63, 0.65);
  --border: rgba(150, 187, 255, 0.18);
  --text: #ebf2ff;
  --muted: #9db3d4;
  --accent: #8dc2ff;
  --accent-strong: #4e9fff;
  --success: #66d19e;
  --warning: #ffd26a;
  --shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(78, 159, 255, 0.2), transparent 28%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #09101d 0%, #08111f 100%);
  color: var(--text);
}

body::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 24px 24px;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), transparent 90%);
}

.shell {
  width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 2rem));
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
}

.hero,
.panel,
.footer {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.hero {
  padding: 3rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 28px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 35, 63, 0.95), rgba(10, 20, 37, 0.95));
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.eyebrow {
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
}

h1,
h2,
h3,
p {
  margin-top: 0;
}

h1 {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  line-height: 1.05;
}

h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.3vw, 2rem);
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}

.hero-copy,
#intro-copy,
.section-heading p,
.repo-summary,
.results-summary,
.footer,
.callout p,
.meta-row,
.repo-links,
.field span,
.empty-state p {
  color: var(--muted);
}

.hero-copy,
#intro-copy {
  font-size: 1.08rem;
  max-width: 68ch;
}

.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.9rem;
  margin: 1.75rem 0 2rem;
}

.button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 2.75rem;
  padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: transform 140ms ease, border-color 140ms ease, background 140ms ease;
}

.button:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  border-color: rgba(150, 187, 255, 0.4);
}

.button.primary {
  color: #04101d;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #d2e9ff);
}

.button.secondary {
  color: var(--text);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
}

.stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  margin: 0;
}

.stat-card {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
}

.stat-card dt {
  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.stat-card dd {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1.45rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.panel {
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1.75rem;
  border-radius: 24px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--panel);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.intro-panel {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 1.25rem;
}

.callout {
  padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(102, 209, 158, 0.25);
  background: rgba(102, 209, 158, 0.08);
}

.callout strong {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.section-heading {
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.filters {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.45rem;
  flex: 1 1 320px;
}

.field.compact {
  flex: 0 1 220px;
}

input,
select {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 2.85rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
  border-radius: 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: rgba(5, 11, 20, 0.9);
  color: var(--text);
  font: inherit;
}

input:focus,
select:focus {
  outline: 2px solid rgba(141, 194, 255, 0.28);
  outline-offset: 1px;
}

.repo-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
}

.repo-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.9rem;
  min-height: 100%;
  padding: 1.15rem;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 35, 63, 0.88), rgba(8, 17, 31, 0.94));
}

.repo-card.featured {
  border-color: rgba(141, 194, 255, 0.38);
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(25, 50, 86, 0.95), rgba(12, 24, 43, 0.96));
}

.repo-title-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0.75rem;
}

.repo-title {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

.repo-title a {
  color: var(--text);
  text-decoration: none;
}

.repo-title a:hover {
  color: var(--accent);
}

.badges,
.topics,
.repo-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.45rem;
}

.badge,
.topic {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 1.8rem;
  padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

